<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n108483" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποκαίω</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποκαθ-κάω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>burn by applying fire below,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὰς ζῶντας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					20.71
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				19.108
			</span></i>; <i>burn underneath,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀστέα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					4.61
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξύλα ὑ. τῷ τρίποδι</span>
			<i>under</i> the tripod, <i><span class="en">
				Anon.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				1146.37
			</span></i>; <i>light sacrificial fires,</i> cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποκλαίω.</span>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>light under,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῦρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Phal.</u>
					1.11
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mete.</u>
				355a17
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. λέβητα, [κακκάβην</span>], <i>light
				a fire under</i> it, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				13.37
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				6.707
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>heat</i> a bath, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PFlor.</u>
				127.4
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A. D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PGiss.</u>
				40 ii 19
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A. D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph. in 
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. τινός</span>
			<i>to be inflamed by love for</i> . . , <i><span class="en">
				Parth.
				12.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				23.2
			</span></i>; <i>to be inflamed,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλύκταιναι -όμεναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.101
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
